  "details": "# Issue:\nRight now the Texture Memory Rank is at the bottom of the Quick Menu Performance Details. This makes it hard to reach.\n# Suggestion:\nThe Texture Memory of an Avatar is a relatively important Performance Stat since VRAM is often a limiting factor in VRChat. It's also similar to the Download Size to I think it should be directly below the download size.\nThis would make it easier to find.\n# Attachments:\nHere you can see it being at the bottom of the list:",
